$ n-queens, the archetypal Essence' model: a matrix, allDiff, and a quantifier
$ whose range is expanded against the parameter.
language ESSENCE' 1.0
given n : int(1..)
where n > 2
letting RANGE be domain int(1..n)
find q : matrix indexed by [int(1..n)] of RANGE
such that
    allDiff(q),
    forall i, j : int(1..n) . i < j -> |q[i] - q[j]| != j - i
